<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SWISS OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWISS OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GSTAAD, Switzerland 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results from the Swiss Open on Monday:</p>
<p>6-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Lucas Arnold (Argentina) 7-5 6-1 8-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) beat Francisco Clavet (Spain) 3-6 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) beat Martin Sinner (Germany) 6-7 (9-11) 7-6 (7-4) 6-4</p>
</text>
